            "type": "text",
            "value": "ROUND\nOutputs a rounded version of the incomming shape\n\n- Patch Explained -\n\n• The sine oscillators run from 0 to 0.2 and back.\n• The oscillator modulates the amount of smoothing\n• The Shape Render is used to convert the Shape2D to and texture.\n"
